{"id":"984509761","kind":"answer","title":"艾宾浩斯记忆曲线到底有没有用？？！？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-01-24","updated":"2021-09-20","votes":212,"comment_count":52,"minutes":1,"chars":659,"keywords":["间隔重复","最小信息原则","知识组织","填空练习","Anki"],"summary":"更新 这篇墨墨背单词的报告写得很详细了： 用艾宾浩斯曲线记忆周期来背单词是否有理论依据？ 有用。但是艾宾浩斯记忆曲线只是保证不断 重复 后能 记住 大部分 信息 。 如果你的目标就是记住信息，艾宾浩斯记忆曲线是有用的。当然，这里存在一个误区，其实真正有用的是 间隔重复 。 一提起艾宾浩斯记忆曲线，就经常会出现下列时间间隔： 5…","question_detail_html":"<p>如题</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/315950273/answer/984509761","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"更新"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\">更新</h2><p data-pid=\"zmpnxlAQ\">这篇墨墨背单词的报告写得很详细了：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d9199f86641bb7438e6dacfeec65a083_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"920\" data-image-width=\"1440\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/19798259/answer/2125871191\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">用艾宾浩斯曲线记忆周期来背单词是否有理论依据？</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"hETED36Z\">有用。但是艾宾浩斯记忆曲线只是保证不断<b>重复</b>后能<b>记住</b>大部分<b>信息</b>。</p><p data-pid=\"KZY-qsEL\">如果你的目标就是记住信息，艾宾浩斯记忆曲线是有用的。当然，这里存在一个误区，其实真正有用的是<b>间隔重复</b>。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-934399b249f646388a9e6a82c8b7f473_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-59f792af5a846a1fae48e1777651927f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-50b26f6aa6ad245ee3e844d04dc1442e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-934399b249f646388a9e6a82c8b7f473_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-59f792af5a846a1fae48e1777651927f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-50b26f6aa6ad245ee3e844d04dc1442e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"oX_LINeB\">一提起艾宾浩斯记忆曲线，就经常会出现下列时间间隔：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"J8EjM9ZZ\">5分钟、30分钟、12小时、1天、2天、4天、7天、15天</blockquote><p data-pid=\"S5sirpES\">这里就存在很多坑！比如：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"l8MVYGO6\">我 1 天后忘记了，那下次间隔还是 2 天吗？</li><li data-pid=\"DI75F8cP\">15 天的周期复习完了，下一次什么时候复习？</li><li data-pid=\"b1XYqk53\">这个内容太难了，按这个周期复习老是记不住</li><li data-pid=\"xW9pUlx_\">这个内容太简单了，按这个周期太浪费时间</li><li data-pid=\"CHbKQFKj\">……</li></ul><p data-pid=\"ClWQtoZi\">为了解决上述问题，我推荐大家使用 Anki 来安排复习。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-a63a21c97a255f91863f205efca7e01e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-fab1149f9d7737128e700929dba7fa60\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8ca8cdfd7ffc50a2ce2a065654381a1e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1058\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-a63a21c97a255f91863f205efca7e01e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-fab1149f9d7737128e700929dba7fa60\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8ca8cdfd7ffc50a2ce2a065654381a1e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1058\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0aa4e5301a20616f59042600aae3ef23_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-af454b6b5a7f7cc7b11c9776044a8151\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-00a433793295a815f5ca61e82baa8bbb_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1402\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0aa4e5301a20616f59042600aae3ef23_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-af454b6b5a7f7cc7b11c9776044a8151\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-00a433793295a815f5ca61e82baa8bbb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1402\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d8597b005c96d32228037ee82636598c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-9ab7ea348a83bb0e990713fd557a2f48\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffa93924ac6237d52d8120dc6ebd5560_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d8597b005c96d32228037ee82636598c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-9ab7ea348a83bb0e990713fd557a2f48\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ffa93924ac6237d52d8120dc6ebd5560_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"aFrqG_sI\">Anki 支持 windows、mac、linux、安卓、苹果等常见设备，并且可以多端同步，走到哪学到哪。</p><p data-pid=\"y57Bb8gF\">为了帮到有缘人，我写了一份快速上手教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2e8a109841199b0a18e70ae7bd16ea66_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"535\" data-image-width=\"1220\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：B 站 Ankidroid 视频教程与电子书(全平台教程)快速通道</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"rfgQX8Td\">另外，还有一个误区，那就是你的目标。</p><p data-pid=\"WzYC1luK\">如果你想要记住一种解题方法，然后用间隔重复记住了一道例题的解法。</p><p data-pid=\"1CzoTp0C\">然而你遇到了一道类似的题目，改动了几个数据，换了几个变量名称，你就不会了。这就是属于泛化能力（举一反三）的问题，间隔重复不背这个锅。</p><p data-pid=\"vee7guWz\">不过，这里依然有一些经验可以介绍：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"JCxwO8W_\">理解记忆的材料</li><li data-pid=\"KDXrfURO\">通过拆分获得更普适的知识</li><li data-pid=\"UDqdxFug\">用自己的话重新组织知识</li><li data-pid=\"xqjUKKDJ\">……</li></ul><p data-pid=\"c9szaa-s\">更多内容可以参考：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5753541fed53c1aa73f9ce332a1ac5d0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"271\" data-image-width=\"732\" data-tm-id=\"52369009\" href=\"#/post/52369009\">叶峻峣：Anki高考的20条原则—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"52369009","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(1-5)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":521,"minutes":7,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"52459340","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(6-10)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":187,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"53919249","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(11-15)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":131,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"54393154","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(16-20)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":116,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"719174183","title":"如何应对记忆难点（Leech）","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":105,"minutes":15,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"},{"id":"691567753","title":"设计明晰 Anki 卡片的规则","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":255,"minutes":17,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"929993903","title":"请问anki当天的卡片背不完的影响是什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":293,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 293 赞同"},{"id":"2063035456","title":"高中生可以用anki作为系统的笔记归纳本吗（不考虑手机限制）?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":41,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 41 赞同"},{"id":"1957235611","title":"被anki的参数设置绕晕了，我该如何用anki背考研专业课？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"1420705020","title":"Anki 为什么新记住的东西必须要等到四天以后才能再次复习记忆？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":34,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 34 赞同"},{"id":"1319219794","title":"anki有什么不足的地方？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":55,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 55 赞同"}]}